# Isaac Stack Refactoring Plan

The goal is to reduce complexity and line-count by **~35–45 %** while making **zero changes** to:
- physics / collision logic ([_circle_hits_box](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#145-152), [_ray_box_intersection_2d](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#110-143), wall parsing)
- OmniGraph wiring ([_build_rtx_lidar_graph](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#745-788), [_create_ros2_base_graph](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py#373-479), [_create_ros_global_graph](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py#480-503))
- autonomy algorithm logic ([simple_frontier_explorer.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/simple_frontier_explorer.py), [simple_scan_mapper.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/simple_scan_mapper.py))
- all launch file *arguments* and *topic wires* (ROS namespace, topic names, remapping, timers)
- the public API that [isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py) imports from `isaac_t_world_bringup`

