## Proposed Changes

---

### 1. Extract [IsaacKinematicBridge](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#989-1155) out of [main()](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#911-1333)

The most impactful single change. Currently the class is defined *inside* [main()](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#911-1333) purely to capture `args` and `walls` through closure. This makes the class untestable and hidden.

#### [MODIFY] [isaac_t_world_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py)

Move [IsaacKinematicBridge](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#989-1155) to module scope (lines 989–1154). Replace closure captures with explicit constructor parameters:

```diff
-class IsaacKinematicBridge(Node):   # defined inside main()
+class IsaacKinematicBridge(Node):   # module-level
     def __init__(self,
+                 namespace: str,
+                 walls: list[WallBox],
+                 args,              # or unpack into typed fields
     ):
         ...
-        self.cmd_linear = float(max(-args.max_linear_speed, ...))  # closure
+        self.cmd_linear = float(max(-self._max_linear, ...))       # self field
```

**Impact**: ~165 lines of class code become testable at the module level. [main()](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#911-1333) shrinks from ~420 lines to ~260.

**What does NOT change**: all ROS topic names, publish logic, collision guards, physics step math.

---

### 2. Merge duplicate [_import_go2_usd_to_stage](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#356-382) functions

[isaac_t_world_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py) lines 338–381 defines [_import_go2_usd_to_stage](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#356-382) **twice** — both definitions have the same signature and neither is called before the second one overwrites the first. The first version uses `pxr` references directly; the second uses the `omni.kit.commands.CreateReferenceCommand` path.

#### [MODIFY] [isaac_t_world_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py)

Delete lines 338–354 (the first, dead definition). Keep only the second definition (lines 356–381). Net reduction: **~17 lines**.

**Risk**: None — Python uses only the last definition of a duplicate name anyway.

---

### 3. Consolidate duplicate URDF import function in dual bringup

[_import_go2_to_stage_dual](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py#237-369) (dual bringup, lines 237–368, ~132 lines) is functionally a superset of [_import_go2_to_stage](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#384-465) (single bringup, lines 384–464, ~81 lines). The dual version adds `before_children` / `after_children` diff logic to resolve which prim was newly created.

#### [MODIFY] [isaac_t_world_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py)

Add an optional `snapshot_before: bool = False` parameter to [_import_go2_to_stage](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py#384-465) that enables the before/after child-set diffing when `True` (needed by dual mode to disambiguate two robots on repeat calls).

#### [MODIFY] [isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py)

Replace [_import_go2_to_stage_dual(...)](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py#237-369) call with `single._import_go2_to_stage(..., snapshot_before=True)`. Delete the now-redundant [_import_go2_to_stage_dual](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_dual_bringup.py#237-369) function body. Net reduction: **~100 lines from dual bringup**.

