### 4. Refactor [_stack_components.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/launch/_stack_components.py) builder boilerplate

All 8 `build_*_node` functions share the identical pattern:
```python
def build_X_node(ns, use_sim_time, extra_params=None, remappings=None, condition=None, name="..."):
    params = [<config>, {"use_sim_time": use_sim_time}]
    if extra_params: params.append(extra_params)
    kwargs = {"package": "...", "executable": "...", "name": name, "parameters": params, "output": "screen"}
    if ns: kwargs["namespace"] = ns
    if remappings: kwargs["remappings"] = remappings
    if condition is not None: kwargs["condition"] = condition
    return Node(**kwargs)
```

#### [MODIFY] [_stack_components.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/launch/_stack_components.py)

Add a single private `_make_node()` helper and rewrite each `build_*` as a 4-6 line thin wrapper:

```python
def _make_node(pkg, exe, ns, use_sim_time, name, extra_base_params=None,
               extra_params=None, remappings=None, condition=None):
    base = extra_base_params or {}
    params = [{**base, "use_sim_time": use_sim_time}]
    if extra_params:
        params.append(extra_params)
    kwargs = dict(package=pkg, executable=exe, name=name,
                  parameters=params, output="screen")
    if ns:         kwargs["namespace"] = ns
    if remappings: kwargs["remappings"] = remappings
    if condition is not None: kwargs["condition"] = condition
    return Node(**kwargs)

def build_rviz_node(rviz_file, use_sim_time, condition=None, namespace=None,
                    remappings=None, name="rviz2"):
    return _make_node("rviz2", "rviz2", namespace, use_sim_time, name,
                      extra_base_params={},   # rviz passes -d via arguments, not params
                      condition=condition, remappings=remappings)
    # Note: rviz2 takes `arguments` not `parameters` — keep as one-off or pass through kwargs
```

> [!NOTE]
> [build_rviz_node](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/launch/_stack_components.py#13-36) passes `arguments=["-d", rviz_file]` rather than parameters, so it stays a direct `Node(...)` call. All other 7 builders become thin wrappers. Net reduction: **~120 lines → ~50 lines** in [_stack_components.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/launch/_stack_components.py).

