## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Change 3 (merging URDF import)** adds a `snapshot_before` boolean to the shared function. Before/after child diffing is needed when two URDF imports happen sequentially in the *same* stage (dual mode). If you ever want to support 3+ robots in one stage, this same mechanism scales correctly. Confirm you are comfortable adding this parameter to the shared function.

> [!WARNING]
> **Change 5 (arg parser refactor)** moves `_make_base_arg_parser` to [isaac_t_world_bringup.py](file:///home/hz/cmu_exploration_ws/src/go2_issac_stack/scripts/isaac_t_world_bringup.py), which is imported by the dual script. This creates a legitimate module dependency but does **not** change any CLI interface visible to the launch files (same flags, same defaults).

---

